# The programs "Join" knows (id, name, executable). GQRX: its configuration file and remote control (port
# 7356) set the frequency, mode and filter. SDR++: started, then tuned through its Rigctl Server module
# (port 4532: to enable in SDR++, "Listen on startup"). rtl_fm: listens in the terminal (aplay plays it),
